### Content aligned with check module

Based on `det-motion-no-auto-play-flash.check.js`:

- **WCAG 2.3.1 threshold:** ≤3 flashes/sec (~0.67s minimum infinite toggle cycle)
- **Violation kinds:** `fast-infinite-animation`, `risky-animation-name`, `risky-keyframes-name`, `autoplay-video`
- **Risky keywords:** `blink`, `flash`, `strobe`, `seizure`, `flicker`

